@page "/paper"
<main class="page">
    <p class="eyebrow">M22 · PAPER TRADING</p>
    <h1>Deterministic paper sessions</h1>
    <p class="hero-copy">Exercise certified long option entries against immutable M21 ticks while the M18 risk policy controls every simulated position size.</p>

    <section class="status-grid">
        <article><span class="card-index">01</span><h2>Authorize</h2><p>A valid, unexpired M19 certificate and explicit operator approval are required for every session.</p></article>
        <article><span class="card-index">02</span><h2>Gate</h2><p>Daily losses, trade count, consecutive losses, capital, whole lots and overlapping positions are checked at each entry.</p></article>
        <article><span class="card-index">03</span><h2>Reconcile</h2><p>Entry and exit fills, fees, P&amp;L, rejection reasons and decision hashes are preserved in one session artifact.</p></article>
    </section>

    <section class="boundary-banner">
        <div><span class="status-dot"></span><strong>Simulation only</strong></div>
        <p>M22 has no broker order endpoint, no live-order authorization and no capability to place, modify or cancel an order.</p>
    </section>
</main>
